  dailyMessages:
  - title: "\U0001F441\uFE0F She's Watching..."
    message: The Nanny never sleeps. Can you escape her terror tonight?
    emoji: "\U0001F441\uFE0F"
  - title: "\U0001F37C The Baby Awaits..."
    message: Shh... the nursery is quiet. Too quiet. Time to escape!
    emoji: "\U0001F37C"
  - title: "\U0001F6AA Doors Are Unlocking..."
    message: The house grows darker. Your escape window is opening...
    emoji: "\U0001F6AA"
  - title: "\U0001F480 Survive Another Night"
    message: The Nanny is hunting. Will you make it out alive?
    emoji: "\U0001F480"
  - title: "\U0001F56F\uFE0F Lights Are Flickering..."
    message: Something stirs in the shadows. Face your fears!
    emoji: "\U0001F56F\uFE0F"
  comeBackMessages:
  - title: "\U0001F47B We've Been Waiting..."
    message: The Nanny hasn't forgotten you. She never forgets...
    emoji: "\U0001F47B"
  - title: "\U0001F52A She Knows You Left..."
    message: Running away won't save you. Come back... if you dare.
    emoji: "\U0001F52A"
  - title: "\U0001F631 Did You Hear That?"
    message: Footsteps in the dark... The terror continues without you!
    emoji: "\U0001F631"
  - title: "\U0001F5A4 The Nightmare Misses You"
    message: The baby is crying... only you can save it from HER.
    emoji: "\U0001F5A4"
  - title: "\u26B0\uFE0F Unfinished Horror..."
    message: You left the baby behind! The Nanny is getting closer to it...
    emoji: "\u26B0\uFE0F"
  streakMessages:
  - title: "\U0001F525 Your Courage Fades..."
    message: Don't let fear win! Keep your survival streak alive!
    emoji: "\U0001F525"
  - title: "\u23F0 Time Is Running Out!"
    message: The Nanny grows stronger each day you're gone. Return NOW!
    emoji: "\u23F0"
